# Data and derived matrices are not stored in this repository.
#
# `data/` holds the competition order file and derived arrays:
#   - trips.parquet        87 MB, cleaned order table
#   - dist_matrix.npy     106 MB, 5,263 x 5,263 cell distance matrix
#   - runs/               per-task simulation outputs
# GitHub rejects files above 100 MB, and the order data is distributed
# under the competition's terms, so it is excluded here.  See DATA.md for
# how to obtain it and rebuild every derived file.
data/

